      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "Learned Deputy Advocate General for the State has shown a copy of the order dated 17.09.2014 passed by the Principal Secretary by which two Tribunals have been constituted i.e. one at Garhwal Division (Dehradun) and Kumaon Division (Haldwani),\nhowever, no Officers have been appointed by the State Government as yet.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 455,
      "end": 771,
